          "text": "{\"packet_id\":\"packet_citizen-guest-005\",\"packet_sha256\":\"37e03697d49bdf15a8c550fc14d9ef116b72f71f4c6e44235bbe84b0519a38ff\",\"schema_version\":\"M050-RECONCILIATION-PROPOSAL-0.1\",\"units\":[{\"authority_basis_atom_keys\":[\"M050-SRC-GUEST-001::GUEST-C0045-M050-SRC-GUEST-001__B01235_aa8327e38fe1__a1\",\"M050-SRC-GUEST-001::GUEST-C0045-M050-SRC-GUEST-001__B01236_bc2cfc379540__a1\",\"M050-SRC-GUEST-001::GUEST-C0045-M050-SRC-GUEST-001__B01237_8d54cec0e5ac__a1\",\"M050-SRC-GUEST-001::GUEST-C0045-M050-SRC-GUEST-001__B01238_3272e38fe7c5__a1\",\"M050-SRC-GUEST-001::GUEST-C0045-M050-SRC-GUEST-001__B01239_54c987778e6d__a1\",\"M050-SRC-GUEST-001::GUEST-C0045-M050-SRC-GUEST-001__B01240_14258f3caf16__a1\",\"M050-SRC-GUEST-001::GUEST-C0045-M050-SRC-GUEST-001__B01240_14258f3caf16__a2\",\"M050-SRC-GUEST-001::GUEST-C0045-M050-SRC-GUEST-001__B01240_14258f3caf16__a3\",\"M050-SRC-GUEST-001::GUEST-C0045-M050-SRC-GUEST-001__B01241_976ffb7c5800__a1\",\"M050-SRC-GUEST-001::GUEST-C0045-M050-SRC-GUEST-001__B01242_2b803640b8a7__a1\",\"M050-SRC-GUEST-001::GUEST-C0045-M050-SRC-GUEST-001__B01243_a9a39313b3fd__a1\",\"M050-SRC-GUEST-001::GUEST-C0045-M050-SRC-GUEST-001__B01244_fcfee08bbc47__a1\",\"M050-SRC-GUEST-001::GUEST-C0045-M050-SRC-GUEST-001__B01245_cc79538fb37f__a1\"],\"canonical_claim\":\"Every Guest requires content for Identity (name, species, silhouette, communication register, and character thesis); Type (Expedition or Resident, chosen for play experience rather than social worth); Citizen form (individual or one of the two authorized collective-bodied households); a First MEET showing the animal acting for its own reasons before recruitment; concrete, visible Terms of Hospitality tied to body, place, safety, habit, or relationship; a Guest House with Mouse, Rabbit, and Squirrel translations, placement needs, and folk-naming direction; Home life covering Role Practice, routine, House use, absence consequences, relationships, and Home MEET hooks; a Signature Permission or Affordance with attribution, situation, limits, and suspension conditions; EMBODY content with at least one meaningful Presence concept and Practice or Flow where appropriate; and Memory covering arrival, relationship, injury, departure, House history, loss, and Chronicle language. Expedition Guests additionally require an Away package containing Permission family, Affinity, Independent Impulse, and shared-system exceptions.\",\"human_question\":\"Which supplied existing MSID should be primary for this cross-register Guest content specification: Citizen.Guest, Home.Colony.Guest, or Away.Guest?\",\"members\":[{\"atom_key\":\"M050-SRC-GUEST-001::GUEST-C0045-M050-SRC-GUEST-001__B01235_aa8327e38fe1__a1\",\"disposition\":\"basis\"},{\"atom_key\":\"M050-SRC-GUEST-001::GUEST-C0045-M050-SRC-GUEST-001__B01236_bc2cfc379540__a1\",\"disposition\":\"basis\"},{\"atom_key\":\"M050-SRC-GUEST-001::GUEST-C0045-M050-SRC-GUEST-001__B01237_8d54cec0e5ac__a1\",\"disposition\":\"basis\"},{\"atom_key\":\"M050-SRC-GUEST-001::GUEST-C0045-M050-SRC-GUEST-001__B01238_3272e38fe7c5__a1\",\"disposition\":\"basis\"},{\"atom_key\":\"M050-SRC-GUEST-001::GUEST-C0045-M050-SRC-GUEST-001__B01239_54c987778e6d__a1\",\"disposition\":\"basis\"},{\"atom_key\":\"M050-SRC-GUEST-001::GUEST-C0045-M050-SRC-GUEST-001__B01240_14258f3caf16__a1\",\"disposition\":\"basis\"},{\"atom_key\":\"M050-SRC-GUEST-001::GUEST-C0045-M050-SRC-GUEST-001__B01240_14258f3caf16__a2\",\"disposition\":\"basis\"},{\"atom_key\":\"M050-SRC-GUEST-001::GUEST-C0045-M050-SRC-GUEST-001__B01240_14258f3caf16__a3\",\"disposition\":\"basis\"},{\"atom_key\":\"M050-SRC-GUEST-001::GUEST-C0045-M050-SRC-GUEST-001__B01241_976ffb7c5800__a1\",\"disposition\":\"basis\"},{\"atom_key\":\"M050-SRC-GUEST-001::GUEST-C0045-M050-SRC-GUEST-001__B01242_2b803640b8a7__a1\",\"disposition\":\"basis\"},{\"atom_key\":\"M050-SRC-GUEST-001::GUEST-C0045-M050-SRC-GUEST-001__B01243_a9a39313b3fd__a1\",\"disposition\":\"basis\"},{\"atom_key\":\"M050-SRC-GUEST-001::GUEST-C0045-M050-SRC-GUEST-001__B01244_fcfee08bbc47__a1\",\"disposition\":\"basis\"},{\"atom_key\":\"M050-SRC-GUEST-001::GUEST-C0045-M050-SRC-GUEST-001__B01245_cc79538fb37f__a1\",\"disposition\":\"basis\"}],\"primary_msid\":null,\"rationale\":\"The atoms are compatible components of one mandatory Guest-content checklist. Their Home and Away scopes are material and retained, but the packet supplies no ruling that selects one of the three candidate MSIDs as primary.\",\"related_local_ids\":[],\"unit_local_id\":\"U001\",\"unit_status\":\"human_required\"},{\"authority_basis_atom_keys\":[\"M050-SRC-047-CROSS-SYSTEM-CARRYFORWARD-001::M050-SRC-047-CROSS-SYSTEM-CARRYFORWARD-001__B00627_4eec9441eb8b__A1\",\"M050-SRC-047-CROSS-SYSTEM-CARRYFORWARD-001::M050-SRC-047-CROSS-SYSTEM-CARRYFORWARD-001__B00644_03e5df13de82__A0001\"],\"canonical_claim\":\"Before a dedicated Guest design pass, Guest species are not to be reduced to four-slot warning-and-capability modules, and cross-system rules must remain valid without deciding detailed Guest species capabilities.\",\"human_question\":\"Which supplied existing MSID should be primary for this Guest-boundary constraint: Citizen.Guest, Home.Colony.Guest, or Away.Guest?\",\"members\":[{\"atom_key\":\"M050-SRC-047-CROSS-SYSTEM-CARRYFORWARD-001::M050-SRC-047-CROSS-SYSTEM-CARRYFORWARD-001__B00627_4eec9441eb8b__A1\",\"disposition\":\"basis\"},{\"atom_key\":\"M050-SRC-047-CROSS-SYSTEM-CARRYFORWARD-001::M050-SRC-047-CROSS-SYSTEM-CARRYFORWARD-001__B00644_03e5df13de82__A0001\",\"disposition\":\"supporting\"}],\"primary_msid\":null,\"rationale\":\"The non-goal and acceptance test are compatible: both prevent a cross-system document from prematurely defining detailed Guest capabilities. No supplied authority resolves their primary ontology path.\",\"related_local_ids\":[],\"unit_local_id\":\"U002\",\"unit_status\":\"human_required\"},{\"authority_basis_atom_keys\":[\"M050-SRC-ECOLOGY-001::M050-SRC-ECOLOGY-001__B00249_4159b691c2e9__A4\",\"M050-SRC-HUMAN-RULINGS-001::ATOM-HUMAN-RULINGS-DIRECT-0123\"],\"canonical_claim\":\"Guest species may occasionally access the Overhead Layer; this is a qualitative ecological access statement, not a mechanically defined capability.\",\"human_question\":\"Should this qualitative access proposition use World.Terrain.Band.OverheadLayer or Citizen.Guest as its primary supplied MSID?\",\"members\":[{\"atom_key\":\"M050-SRC-ECOLOGY-001::M050-SRC-ECOLOGY-001__B00249_4159b691c2e9__A4\",\"disposition\":\"basis\"}],\"primary_msid\":null,\"rationale\":\"The Ecology atom establishes occasional Guest access. The Human Ruling limits ecological influence to qualitative translation and leaves mechanical expression to dedicated system owners, so no specific Guest capability follows. The packet does not settle which supplied candidate MSID is primary.\",\"related_local_ids\":[],\"unit_local_id\":\"U003\",\"unit_status\":\"human_required\"}]}"
